<title>NETHERLANDS: VNU 1996 net profit NLG 322 million.</title>
<headline>VNU 1996 net profit NLG 322 million.</headline>
<dateline>HAARLEM, Netherlands 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year 1996</p>
<p>(millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit incl. extraordinary items    322  vs  430</p>
<p>    Dividend (guilders)			  0.55  vs  0.48</p>
<p>    Turnover (billions)			  3.37  vs  3.05</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had expected 1996 net profit from ordinary operations of 312 to 317 million guilders. Big extraordinary gain in 1995 stemmed from sale of U.S. financial info unit Disclosure.  </p>
<p>    Net profit from ordinary ops		316  vs  274</p>
<p>    Ditto per share (guilders)		 1.67  vs  1.44</p>
<p>    Extraordinary items		   gain    5  vs  157  gain</p>
<p>    Total operating costs (billions)	 2.94  vs  2.70</p>
<p>    Operating profit excl associates	  433  vs  353</p>
<p>    Income from associates			 27  vs  53</p>
<p>    Net financial charges			  10  vs  13</p>
<p>    Taxes					     134  vs  119</p>
</text>
